voice 03/24: Inside one station
voice 04/24: The line runs at the speed of its slowest station
voice 05/24: Every part is the same six motions
voice 06/24: The walk out
voice 07/24: The lift, limb by limb
voice 08/24: Carrying is not linear in the load
voice 09/24: Getting it where it lands
voice 10/24: Where the shift actually goes
voice 11/24: The rest that is not slacking
voice 12/24: The body doing the work
voice 13/24: You are the heaviest thing you lift
voice 14/24: Legs, trunk, arms
voice 15/24: When one person stops lifting alone
voice 16/24: The same part costs more up high
voice 17/24: The part that is exact
voice 18/24: The part that is a model
voice 19/24: Nineteen per cent, and a fifth of one per cent
voice 20/24: The whole dome, by motion
voice 21/24: The ledger, station by station
voice 22/24: What one working day costs
voice 23/24: The total, in food
voice 24/24: What the ledger changes
